Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:43:49 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(web): open sidebar filter submenus in place on mobile
 (#13481)

On a phone-width sidebar drawer the Grouping, Display, Ordering and Show
submenus opened as Radix side flyouts. Neither side of the menu had room,
so Radix flipped the flyout left and clipped its labels off the screen.

On mobile viewports these submenus now replace the main menu body in
place under a back row, matching the session row and header menus.
Desktop keeps the side flyouts.

Backport: this is upstream's merged commit a563d5a0dc
(omnigent-ai/omnigent#13481, merged 2026-11-11), unchanged. BASE predates
it, so the series carries it until the next refresh, where it applies as
empty: drop this copy then.

